# T-1542: Structural alias — [type [lowercase-keyed dict body]] is unchanged.
# [type [port: Int hostname: String]] declares NginxConfig as a structural alias
# (transparent record type). @NginxConfig on a dict expands to the record body.
# This form (single positional lowercase-keyed dict) is NOT migrated — it remains valid.
[
  NginxConfig: [type [port: Int  hostname: String]]
  cfg: [@NginxConfig [port: 8080  hostname: "localhost"]]
  p: cfg.port
  h: cfg.hostname
]
=== out
Dict({"NginxConfig": Dict({}), "cfg": Dict({"port": Int(8080), "hostname": String("localhost")}), "p": Int(8080), "h": String("localhost")})
